 168:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c **** /** @defgroup DMA_Group1 Initialization and Configuration functions
 169:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****  *  @brief   Initialization and Configuration functions
 170:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****  *
 171:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c **** @verbatim   
 172:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****  ===============================================================================
 173:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****                 ##### Initialization and Configuration functions #####
 174:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 175:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     [..]
 176:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     This subsection provides functions allowing to initialize the DMA Stream source
 177:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     and destination addresses, incrementation and data sizes, transfer direction, 
 178:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     buffer size, circular/normal mode selection, memory-to-memory mode selection 
 179:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     and Stream priority value.
 180:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     [..]
 181:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     The DMA_Init() function follows the DMA configuration procedures as described in
 182:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     reference manual (RM0090) except the first point: waiting on EN bit to be reset.
 183:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     This condition should be checked by user application using the function DMA_GetCmdStatus()
 184:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****     before calling the DMA_Init() function.
 185:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c **** 
 186:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c **** @endverbatim
 187:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   * @{
 188:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   */
 189:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c **** 
