 307:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c **** 
 308:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c **** /**
 309:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the DMAy Streamx according to the specified parameters in 
 310:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *         the DMA_InitStruct structure.
 311:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   * @note   Before calling this function, it is recommended to check that the Stream 
 312:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *         is actually disabled using the function DMA_GetCmdStatus().  
