ARM GAS  /tmp/ccx7iGzk.s 			page 18


 455:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *         to 7 to select the DMA Stream.
 456:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   * @param  NewState: new state of the DMAy Streamx. 
 457:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *          This parameter can be: ENABLE or DISABLE.
 458:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *
 459:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   * @note  This function may be used to perform Pause-Resume operation. When a
 460:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        transfer is ongoing, calling this function to disable the Stream will
 461:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        cause the transfer to be paused. All configuration registers and the
 462:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        number of remaining data will be preserved. When calling again this
 463:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        function to re-enable the Stream, the transfer will be resumed from
 464:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        the point where it was paused.          
 465:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *    
 466:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   * @note  After configuring the DMA Stream (DMA_Init() function) and enabling the
 467:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        stream, it is recommended to check (or wait until) the DMA Stream is
 468:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        effectively enabled. A Stream may remain disabled if a configuration 
 469:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        parameter is wrong.
 470:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        After disabling a DMA Stream, it is also recommended to check (or wait
 471:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        until) the DMA Stream is effectively disabled. If a Stream is disabled 
 472:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        while a data transfer is ongoing, the current data will be transferred
 473:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        and the Stream will be effectively disabled only after the transfer of
 474:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *        this single data is finished.            
 475:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *    
 476:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   * @retval None
 477:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   */
