 720:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   * @param  DMA_CurrentMemory: specifies which memory will be first buffer for
 721:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *         the transactions when the Stream will be enabled. 
 722:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
